-explanation"><p>Correct option:</p>

<p><strong>Use S3 Express One Zone</strong></p>

<p>Amazon S3 Express One Zone is a high-performance S3 storage class design=
ed to provide consistent single-digit millisecond data access. AWS designed=
 it for frequently accessed data and applications that require very low req=
uest latency.</p>

<p>S3 Express One Zone stores data redundantly across multiple devices with=
in a single Availability Zone. Applications can colocate compute resources =
and S3 Express One Zone storage in the same Availability Zone to achieve hi=
gh-performance access.</p>

<p>This storage class is appropriate for latency-sensitive workloads such a=
s interactive analytics, machine learning, media processing, and other appl=
ications that frequently access objects and require extremely fast response=
 times.</p>

