y Zones.</p>

<p>S3 Standard does not provide the specialized consistent single-digit mil=
lisecond access performance that S3 Express One Zone is designed to deliver=
. Therefore, it does not best satisfy the requirement.</p>

<p><strong>Use S3 Glacier Instant Retrieval</strong> - S3 Glacier Instant R=
etrieval provides millisecond retrieval for archive data that organizations=
