diate access when retrieval becomes necessary.</p>

<p>The requirement specifically calls for consistent single-digit milliseco=
nd access to frequently accessed objects. S3 Express One Zone is purpose-bu=
ilt for this performance-sensitive access pattern.</p>

<p><strong>Use S3 Standard-IA</strong> - S3 Standard-IA is designed for dat=
a that organizations access infrequently but need to retrieve rapidly when =
required. It provides millisecond access while reducing storage costs compa=
red with frequently accessed storage classes.</p>

<p>The workload in this scenario emphasizes consistently low latency for fr=
equently accessed objects rather than infrequent access. S3 Express One Zon=
e is specifically optimized for this performance requirement.</p>

